{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Days until my due date?》是一款陪伴準媽媽走過整個孕期的工具，由預產期計算與倒數開始，延伸至寶寶名字靈感、每週孕期狀態與私人日記，適合剛確認懷孕或已進入最後幾週的孕婦使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-21.webp\">\n<h2>孕期倒數與貼心小工具</h2>\n<p>開啟程式即見簡潔的預產期計算器與倒數計時，清楚掌握剩餘日子。程式另設寶寶名字生成器、每週孕期狀態與私人日記，可記下心情、夢境與飲食偏好，並預測寶寶星座。內置智能計算器協助估算受孕日期、追蹤重要里程碑與規劃大學儲蓄，另附輕鬆小遊戲讓思緒休息。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-655-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-656-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-657-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-658-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-659-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-660-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Days until my due date?</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:40:22.853117+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:28:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:57:59.107552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:36.098755+00:00","content_hash":"b3a3f32a837e048f52ea55a9afa0e75611303cd1b381ce90ee46dd79ab12f589","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}